sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant A as app.py
    participant B as batch.py
    participant P as Analyzer
    U->>A: Upload CSV and press Analyze file
    A->>B: analyze_dataframe(df, analyzer, max_rows)
    B->>B: find text column, count reviews per user per day
    B->>P: analyze_batch(texts, posts_per_day, 999)
    P-->>B: verdict, fake chance, trust, level per review
    B->>B: build users table with user trust and status
    B-->>A: reviews table, users table, accuracy if label exists
    A->>A: keep result in session state
    A-->>U: KPIs, charts, tables, download buttons
